      "text": "Orchestrator Agent - Understand the task\n.. create the plan and spawn Agents \nAdd Agents for every integration \nAdd normal read write terminal tool for now\nAdd MCP Tools and Skills \nWait for final output to be written in a file\nSave the session against SessionId so it\ncan be reused in future if required",
